==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Ice Keese Wings are dropped by [[Ice Keese]], which can be found in [[Freezing Climate]]s such as the [[Hebra Mountains]] and [[Mount Lanayru]]. They are [[Monster Part]]s and can be used in a [[Cooking Pot]] to create [[Elixir]]s. They can also be exchanged for [[Mon]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] or used to make [[Blue Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

Ice Keese Wings are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Ice Keese Wing}}

